sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Intake topic
  participant C as Intake consumer
  participant X as Dead-letter writer
  participant DLQ as Dead-letter topic
  participant Q as Job queue
  K->>C: batch of 200
  C->>C: decode each message
  alt can never insert (Q3): no key decrypts, bad JSON, schema invalid
    C->>X: message, fixed reason code
    X->>X: breaker: 3+ and over 10% of batch? (Q4)
    alt breaker trips
      X-->>C: throw, partition stalls, alert
    else under the breaker
      X->>DLQ: original encrypted bytes + dlq_* headers
      DLQ-->>X: ack
    end
  end
  C->>Q: createJobsIdempotently(rest)
  alt Postgres error or timeout
    Q-->>C: throw
    C-->>K: no offsets stored, process restarts, batch redelivered
    Note over C,Q: redelivered claims return replayed for rows that committed
  else committed
    Q-->>C: outcomes
    C-->>K: store offsets
  end
